  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Kua whakaraihanatia ngā tauira waehere, ngā JSON Schema, me ngā tauira kaupapa here pānui-mīhini i raro i te MIT License, mēnā kāhore i whakaaturia kētia. Ka āhei koe ki te whakatakoto i ēnei ki ō ake paetukutuku, kāore he aukati.",
  "Combined rights entry point": "Pito urunga tika kua whakakotahitia",
