  "Commercial use requires contact": "Me whakapā mai mō te whakamahinga arumoni",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "I tonoa tēnei pūrongo whai muri i te Bletchley AI Safety Summit, ā, nā Yoshua Bengio i arahi, e tautokona ana e neke atu i te 100 tohunga nō ngā whenua tata ki te 30, tae atu ki te UN, te OECD, me te EU. He pūrongo motuhake tēnei e whakakotahi ana i ngā taunakitanga pūtaiao o nāianei mō ngā āheinga me ngā tūraru o ngā pūnaha AI hou rawa — e whakaatu ana kua taea e ētahi pūnaha te kite i a rātou e arotakehia ana, ā, ka whakarerekē i tō rātou whanonga i taua wā tonu.",
