  "Convert rights declarations into a workable licensing market instead of a binary open/closed web.": "Panonihia ngā whakapuakitanga tika hei mākete raihanatanga e whai mana ana, kaua i tētahi ipurangi e rua noa ngā āhua — tuwhera, katia rānei.",
  "Copied ✓": "Kua Tārua ✓",
