  "Correct positioning: independent research drafts, protocol proposals, and an open specification experiment.": "Te tūnga tika: he hukihuki rangahau motuhake, he tāpaetanga kawa, he whakamātautau tautuhinga tuwhera hoki.",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Belgium (BE) now maps to Dutch instead of French — Flemish speakers are the country’s majority (~60%) over Walloon French speakers (~40%).": "I whakatikahia tētahi taunoa o mua: ko Belgium (BE) ināianei e whakatauria ana ki Dutch, kaua ki French — ko ngā kaikōrero Flemish te nuinga o te motu (~60%) i runga ake i ngā kaikōrero Walloon French (~40%).",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Kazakhstan (KZ) now maps to Kazakh instead of Russian, now that a Kazakh translation exists — the same kind of fix as the earlier Belgium correction.": "I whakatikahia tētahi taunoa o mua: ko Kazakhstan (KZ) ināianei e whakatauria ana ki Kazakh, kaua ki Russian, nā te mea kua whai whakamāoritanga Kazakh ināianei — he rite tonu tēnei momo whakatikatika ki tō mua mō Belgium.",
  "Could AI Be Conscious?": "Could AI Be Conscious?",
  "Crawler access rules": "Ngā Ture Urunga Kaikohi",
