  "in-browser + live API": "i roto i te pūtirotiro + API ā-tere",
  "inference_input — use as context at inference time (RAG)": "inference_input — hei horopaki i te wā whakatau (RAG)",
  "license required": "e hiahiatia ana he raihana",
  "may proceed (with conditions)": "ka taea te haere tonu (he tikanga anō)",
  "missing": "ngaro",
  "not permitted": "kāore e whakaaetia ana",
  "now": "ināianei",
  "quotation — excerpt limits and attribution rules": "whakahuatanga — ngā rohe wāhanga me ngā ture tautohu pūtake",
  "rag_use — retrieval-augmented generation, retention windows": "rag_use — RAG (retrieval-augmented generation), ngā wā pupuritanga",
  "read_access — whether AI may fetch and read the content": "read_access — mēnā ka whakaaetia te AI ki te tiki me te pānui i te ihirangi",
  "redistribution — republishing or redistributing content or derivatives": "tuari anō — te tā anō, te tuari anō rānei i te ihirangi, i ōna hua panoni rānei",
  "research pages & whitepapers": "ngā whārangi rangahau me ngā pukapuka mā",
  "robots.txt and llms.txt govern access and visibility, not learning depth or use permissions. AIRS proposes expressing AI rights as a proportional, use-specific spectrum across ten dimensions — access, indexing, inference input, embedding, training, fine-tuning, distillation, memory, output, attribution/compensation. AILP translates this into /ai/rights-spectrum.json, letting creators declare granular permissions with compensation models ranging from free through license-required to revenue share.": "Ko te robots.txt me te llms.txt ngā mea e whakahaere ana i te urunga me te kitea, ehara i te hōhonutanga ako, i ngā whakaaetanga whakamahi rānei. E tāpae ana a AIRS kia whakaputaina ngā tika AI hei whānuitanga taurite, whakamahi-motuhake, puta noa i ngā āhuatanga tekau — te urunga, te tūtohitanga, te horopaki whakatau, te embedding, te whakangungu, te whakatikatika, te distillation, te mahara, te putanga, me te tautohu pūtake/utu. Mā AILP tēnei e whakaputa hei /ai/rights-spectrum.json, e taea ai e ngā kaihanga te whakapuaki i ngā whakaaetanga taipitopito me ngā tauira utu, mai i te kore-utu, mā te raihana-e-hiahiatia, tae noa ki te wehewehenga moni whiwhi.",
  "schema-invalid": "Schema-kore-tika",
  "schema-valid": "Schema-tika",
  "site guide for AI systems": "aratohu pae mō ngā pūnaha AI",
  "summarization — summaries, with or without attribution": "whakarāpopototanga — ngā whakarāpopoto, ahakoa he tautohu pūtake, kāore rānei",
  "this site’s AI content rights policy": "te kaupapa here tika ihirangi AI a tēnei pae",
  "this site’s license catalog": "te puka rārangi raihana a tēnei pae",
  "training / fine_tuning / distillation — model internalization tiers": "whakangungu / fine_tuning / distillation — ngā taumata whakaurunga-ā-roto mō te tauira",
  "training — model training and fine-tuning permission": "whakangungu — te whakaaetanga whakangungu tauira me te whakatikatika",
  "transformation — structured extraction and derivative works": "panonitanga — te tangohanga hanganga me ngā mahi hua-panoni",
  "undeclared — high-risk pipelines may exclude": "kāore i whakapuakina — ka taea e ngā tukanga tūraru-nui te whakakore",
  "verbatim_memory — whether exact reproduction is permitted": "verbatim_memory — mēnā ka whakaaetia te whakaputa anō tika-tonu",
  "versioned, citable, traceable": "kua whakaputangatia, ka taea te tohutoro, ka taea te whāia",
  "“AICL: AI Ingestion & Capability Layer” now published in English as the canonical edition; the Chinese original manuscript remains available and both versions cross-link.": "“AICL: AI Ingestion & Capability Layer” kua whakaputaina ināianei ki te reo Ingarihi hei putanga tūturu; kei te wātea tonu te tuhinga Hainamana taketake, ā, ka hono whakawhiti ngā putanga e rua.",
  "“Protocolized Openness” confirmed as an English-language paper (with Chinese parallel passages) — no separate translation planned.": "“Protocolized Openness” kua whakaūhia hei pepa reo Ingarihi (me ōna wāhanga whakarite Hainamana) — kāore he whakamāoritanga motuhake e whakaritea ana.",
  "↑ live machine-readable policy of this site": "↑ te kaupapa here pānui-mīhini ā-tere a tēnei pae",
  "⚠ Signature valid, but the token has expired": "⚠ He tika te waitohu, engari kua pau te wā o te tohu",
  "✓ Signature valid": "✓ He tika te waitohu",
  "✓ Valid against": "✓ He tika ki",
  "✗ Does not match schema": "✗ Kāore e rite ana ki te Schema",
